cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below, and also cite the original study and dataset listed under references."
title: "Splotchy-face GWAS in cattle: reanalysis of public data identifies a single locus at MITF"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Thaufiq"
    given-names: "Md."
    # affiliation: "Bangladesh Agricultural University"
    
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-18
repository-code: "https://github.com/Thaufiq2004/cattle-splotchy-face-gwas"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - GWAS
  - cattle
  - splotchy face
  - coat colour
  - MITF
  - PLINK 2
  - Firth regression
abstract: >-
  Independent reanalysis of a public genotype and phenotype dataset (128 Hereford-cross calves, 41,534 SNPs)
  for the splotchy-face coat phenotype in cattle, using Firth logistic regression in PLINK 2 with
  principal-component adjustment. Thirty-seven genome-wide significant SNPs on chromosome 22 (31.57-32.42 Mb) form
  a single LD clump that includes the pigmentation gene MITF. Robustness is assessed by duplicate-sample removal,
  genomic control and removal of related animals.
